  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Program f&#xf6;r landsbygdsutveckling i Burkina Faso som st&#xf6;tts tilsammans med Schweiz och Belgien 2001-2003. Sida-medel anv&#xe4;ndes efter att avtal l&#xf6;pt ut. Beg&#xe4;rd &#xe5;terbetalning mottagen fr&#xe5;n Burkina Fasos regering. Insatsen st&#xe4;ngd.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for rural development supported by Switzerlan, Belgium and Sweden 2001-2003. Sida funds were used after expiry of agreement. Reimbursment received from Burkina Faso government. Contribution closed.</narrative>
  </description>
